<div class=chatlog__message-group><div id=chatlog__message-container-1558533245266559071 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1558533245266559071><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><img class=chatlog__avatar src=https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/4.png alt=Avatar loading=lazy></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__header><span class=chatlog__author title=dadventuressteve data-user-id=1264035953933156432>Veilocity</span> <span class=chatlog__timestamp title="Saturday, October 10, 2026 1:34 PM"><a href=#chatlog__message-container-1558533245266559071>10/10/2026 1:34 PM</a></span></div><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve><strong><img
